# Allumnova — Feature Gap Analysis
_Every feature analyzed for complete user loop. Severity: 🔴 Critical / 🟡 Partial / 🟢 Complete_

---

## 1. 🔴 Notifications — Broken Loop

| Step | Status |
|---|---|
| See notification in list | ✅ Works |
| Connect request shows Accept/Decline buttons | ✅ Shows |
| Clicking Accept/Decline actually does anything | ❌ **Buttons are not wired to any API call** |
| Likes/comments generate notifications in the list | ❌ **Only connection requests appear; likes and comments missing** |
| "Mark all as read" button | ❌ **Decorative — no API call behind it** |
| Clicking a notification navigates to the related post/profile | ❌ **No navigation on click** |

**Loop Break**: User gets notified but can't act on it from the notification panel.

---

## 2. 🔴 Launchpad — Multiple Broken Loops

| Step | Status |
|---|---|
| Browse project cards | ✅ Works |
| Filter by "Seeking Collaborators" | ✅ Works |
| Search projects by name/tech | ❌ **Search bar is missing entirely** |
| Hype a project | ✅ Works |
| Project owner can edit their project | ❌ **No Edit button on cards you own** |
| Project owner can delete their project | ❌ **No Delete option** |
| Project owner can update milestone progress | ❌ **No UI for milestone toggling** |
| Someone interested can contact the creator | ❌ **"Looking for" shows info but clicking it does nothing** |
| Click project to see full detail page | ❌ **No project detail/single-project page exists** |

**Loop Break**: You can post a project but you can never update it, manage it, or interact with it beyond a hype tap.

---

## 3. 🔴 Mentorship — Exists in Backend, Not in Frontend

| Step | Status |
|---|---|
| Backend routes exist (`POST /request`, `GET /requests`, `PATCH /status`) | ✅ Backend ready |
| Frontend page or UI to request mentorship | ❌ **No page exists** |
| Request button triggers from Profile page | ❌ **Mentorship modal exists but receives no data on submit** |
| Alumni can accept/reject mentorship requests | ❌ **No panel exists** |
| Mentorship chat or session scheduling | ❌ **Completely missing** |

**Loop Break**: This feature is phantom — backend exists, UI starts with a modal, but goes nowhere.

---

## 4. 🟡 Feed — Partial Loop

| Step | Status |
|---|---|
| View, create, edit, delete posts | ✅ Complete |
| Like (Appreciate) a post | ✅ Complete |
| Comment on a post | ✅ Complete |
| "Boost" a post | ❌ **Boost button calls the API but the score doesn't actually re-rank the post for others in real-time** |
| "Share" a post | ❌ **Share icon is entirely decorative — no clipboard copy, no link share** |
| "Connect" button on PostCard | ❌ **Visible but does nothing (no API call)** |
| Post type filtering (General/Opportunity/Event/Achievement) | ✅ Works |

**Loop Break**: Social engagement actions (Share, Boost, Connect-from-post) are cosmetic only.

---

## 5. 🟡 Connections — Partial Loop

| Step | Status |
|---|---|
| Send connection request from Discover | ✅ Works |
| Receive and accept/decline from Connections page | ✅ Works |
| View your accepted connections list | ✅ Works |
| Click "Message" on a connection | ❌ **Button exists but doesn't open Chat or navigate to Chat with that user pre-selected** |
| "Remove" a connection | ❌ **Button exists, no API call behind it** |
| Discover search filters by name/role/batch | ✅ Added recently |

**Loop Break**: You build a network but can't message them from the network screen.

---

## 6. 🟡 Chat — Partial Loop

| Step | Status |
|---|---|
| Start a new chat from connections | ✅ Works |
| Send text messages | ✅ Works |
| Send image/file in chat | ✅ Works |
| Real-time message delivery via WebSocket | ✅ Works |
| Unread message badge | ✅ Works |
| Search existing conversations | ❌ **Conversation list has no search bar** |
| Message reactions / reply-to-message / forward | ❌ **Not implemented** |
| Delete a sent message | ❌ **Not implemented** |

**Loop Break**: Chat is functional but feels bare; one-on-one only, no message management.

---

## 7. 🟡 Profile — Partial Loop

| Step | Status |
|---|---|
| View own + public profiles | ✅ Works |
| Edit bio, name, department | ✅ Works |
| Upload profile photo | ✅ Works (fixed in latest deploy) |
| Pulse / status update | ✅ Works |
| See reputation tier badge | ✅ Works |
| View own posts tab | ✅ Works |
| View connections count | ✅ Shows |
| See what connections a user has (mutual connections) | ❌ **Not implemented** |
| LinkedIn / portfolio links are saved | ✅ Works |
| LinkedIn links are clickable on profile view | ✅ Works |

**Loop Break**: Profile is mostly solid. The only major gap is no "mutual connections" display.

