| Browse Colleges tab | ✅ Works |
| Join a college | ✅ Works |

**Loop Break**: You can join a Hub but then nothing happens — no Hub feed, members list, or content.

---

## 9. 🟡 Onboarding — Partial Loop

| Step | Status |
|---|---|
| Sign up with email & password | ✅ Works |
| Add department, batch year, role | ✅ Works |
| Upload document for verification | ✅ Works |
| Redirect to pending approval page | ✅ Works |
| Admin receives and approves application | ✅ Works |
| User **automatically notified** when approved | ❌ **No email/notification sent to user on approval** |
| User must manually log in again to see they're verified | ❌ **No real-time approval push** |

**Loop Break**: User submits docs, then waits in the dark. No "you've been approved!" notification.

---

## 10. 🟢 Admin Dashboard — Mostly Complete

| Step | Status |
|---|---|
| View pending verification requests | ✅ Works |
| Approve / Reject users | ✅ Works |
| Manage colleges and requests | ✅ Works |
| View all users and their roles | ✅ Works |
| Force-verify or remove a user | ✅ Works |

---

## Priority Summary

| Priority | Feature | Gap |
|---|---|---|
| 🔴 Fix Now | Notifications | Wire Accept/Decline buttons to the API |
| 🔴 Fix Now | Launchpad | Add search, Edit/Delete for owner, Milestones update UI |
| 🔴 Fix Now | Mentorship | Build frontend UI or remove dead modal |
| 🟡 Soon | Feed | Wire Share (clipboard link), wire Connect button |
| 🟡 Soon | Connections | Wire Message → navigate to Chat, wire Remove |
| 🟡 Soon | Onboarding | Send email/notification when user is approved |
| 🟡 Soon | Hubs | Build Hub detail/feed page after joining |
| 🟢 Later | Chat | Add search, message reactions, delete |
| 🟢 Later | Profile | Add mutual connections |
